# Deposit-scope decision (2026-06-14): commit reports + contact sheets + the small
# Palace Studio tooling only. The heavy galleries (variations / landscapes / posters /
# flux heroes / Icon) and the movies (gif/mp4) stay on local disk, out of the palace repo.
*.png
*.gif
*.mp4
# ...but keep the contact sheets (they ARE the evidence we want in git):
!*contact_sheet*.png

# secrets + runtime junk (studio/.gitignore also covers these)
studio/config.json
studio/.studio.pid
studio/.studio.log
**/__pycache__/
.DS_Store
